---
import CaseStudy from '../../layouts/CaseStudy.astro';
---

<CaseStudy
  caseTitle="3D Mobifans"
  caseDesc="3D Mobifans — modelagem, renders e animações para o Instagram a partir das medidas reais dos fornecedores."
  casePath="/projetos/mobi_3d.html"
  ogImage="/projetos/mobi_3d/Banner_mobi_3d_21_9.webp"
  heroImageHref="/projetos/mobi_3d/Banner_mobi_3d_21_9.webp"
>

  <div class="mobi-3d-page">

  <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
  <div class="case-breadcrumb">
    <div class="container case-breadcrumb__inner">
      <a class="case-breadcrumb__link" href="../projetos.html" data-en="← Projects">← Projetos</a>
      <span class="case-breadcrumb__sep">·</span>
      <span class="case-breadcrumb__current" data-en="Case">Case</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CASE HEADER -->
  <section class="case-header" aria-labelledby="case-title">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="case-header__eyebrow" data-en="Case · 3D · Motion · Client">
        Case · 3D · Motion · Mobifans
      </p>
      <h1 class="case-header__title" id="case-title">
        3D<br />Mobifans.
      </h1>
      <div class="case-header__meta">
        <span class="case-header__date" data-en="2026">2026</span>
        <div class="case-header__tags">
          <span class="tech-tag">Blender</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">After Effects</span>
          <span class="tech-tag" data-en="3D Modeling">Modelagem 3D</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">Motion Design</span>
          <span class="tech-tag" data-en="Texturing">Texturização</span>
          <span class="tech-tag">Social Media</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- HERO DO CASE -->
  <div class="case-hero" role="img" aria-label="Banner do projeto 3D Mobifans">
    <img class="case-hero__img" src="/projetos/mobi_3d/Banner_mobi_3d_21_9.webp"
         alt="3D Mobifans — renders e animações para o Instagram" width="2100" height="900" loading="eager" />
  </div>

  <!-- 01 — CONTEXTO / PROBLEMA -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="ctx-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="ctx-title" data-en="01 — Context / Problem">01 — Contexto / Problema</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="3D · renders · no photo equipment">3D · renders · sem equipamento fotográfico</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-grid-2" data-reveal>
        <div>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);" data-en="Mobifans needed high-quality images for the Customic line for the website, social media and ads. The problem: with no professional photography equipment available, conventional photos couldn't communicate the material's texture, the edge thickness, or the camera and button cutouts.">
            A <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">Mobifans</strong> precisava de imagens de alta qualidade para a linha <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">Customic</strong> para o site, redes sociais e anúncios. O problema: sem equipamento fotográfico profissional disponível, as fotos convencionais não comunicavam a textura do material, a espessura das bordas nem os recortes de câmera e botões.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-6);" data-en="The solution was to implement 3D. I went straight to the Customic case suppliers to get real measurements — the TPU thickness, edge radius, and the exact position of each cutout. With that data in hand, I built high-precision 3D models in Blender.">
            A solução foi <strong style="color: var(--color-ink);">implementar o 3D</strong>. Fui direto aos fornecedores das capas Customic para obter as medidas reais. Buscando a espessura do TPU, raio das bordas, posição exata de cada recorte. Com esses dados em mãos, criei modelos 3D de alta precisão no Blender.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Once the models existed, the next step was optimizing them to be progressively lighter and easier to animate.">
            Uma vez que os modelos existiam, a próxima etapa foi otimizar os modelos para serem cada vez mais leves e fáceis de animar.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5);">
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);" data-en="Context">Contexto</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Mobifans — a smartphone accessories store. Goal: high-quality product images for the Customic line without relying on photography equipment — and, from the models, create animations for Instagram.">
              Mobifans — loja de acessórios para smartphones. Objetivo: imagens de produto em alta qualidade para a linha Customic sem depender de equipamento fotográfico — e, a partir dos modelos, criar animações para o Instagram.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2);" data-en="Core challenge">Problema central</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted);" data-en="Conventional photos couldn't communicate the product's texture, thickness and cutouts. Lack of professional photography equipment limited the angles and lighting quality achievable.">
              Fotos convencionais não comunicavam textura, espessura e recortes do produto. Falta de equipamento fotográfico profissional limitava os ângulos e a qualidade de iluminação.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="border: var(--border-thick); background: var(--color-yellow); box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); padding: var(--space-5);">
            <p class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-ink);" data-en="Opportunity">Oportunidade</p>
            <p style="font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink);" data-en="3D models built from real supplier measurements — full control over lighting, camera and movement for images and animations impossible to replicate with conventional photography.">
              Modelos 3D a partir das medidas reais dos fornecedores — controle total de luz, câmera e movimento para imagens e animações impossíveis de replicar na fotografia convencional.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 — MEU PAPEL -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="papel-title" style="background: var(--color-surface);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="papel-title" data-en="02 — My Role">02 — Meu Papel</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="modeling · texturing · animation · social">modelagem · texturização · animação · social</span>
      </div>
      <div class="case-grid-3" data-reveal>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="3D">3D</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Coordination with suppliers to obtain real measurements. High-precision modeling in Blender replicating the thickness, cutouts and curvature of the physical product — the foundation for renders and animations.">
            Coordenação com fornecedores para obter medidas reais. Modelagem de alta precisão no Blender replicando espessura, recortes e curvatura do produto físico — base para renders e animações.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="Renders & Textures">Renders & Texturas</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="UV unwrapping, PBR maps (base color, roughness, texture) simulating the real matte TPU finish. Scene setup with HDRI and area lights for renders that stand in for product photography.">
            UV unwrapping, mapas PBR (cor base, rugosidade, textura) simulando o TPU fosco real. Configuração de cena com HDRI e luzes de área para renders que substituem a fotografia de produto.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="role-card">
          <span class="role-card__label" data-en="Responsibility">Responsabilidade</span>
          <h3 class="role-card__title" data-en="Animation & Social">Animação & Social</h3>
          <p class="role-card__desc" style="text-align: justify;" data-en="Animation in Blender, compositing in After Effects and adaptation for Instagram formats — 9:16 reels and 1:1 feed — including the Triad: three animations with a connected visual identity.">
            Animação no Blender, composição no After Effects e adaptação para o formato Instagram — reels 9:16 e feed 1:1 — incluindo a Tríade: três animações com identidade visual conectada.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 — PROCESSO & SOLUÇÃO -->
  <section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="processo-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="case-section__header">
        <p class="section-label" id="processo-title" data-en="03 — Process & Solution">03 — Processo & Solução</p>
        <span class="case-section__note" data-en="supplier reference · modeling · texture · render · animation">fornecedor · modelagem · textura · render · animação</span>
      </div>

      <div class="case-img-pair" data-reveal>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_3d/Processo_01.webp" alt="Medidas e referências obtidas com o fornecedor" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="step 01 · supplier reference · real measurements">Passo 01 · Referência do Fornecedor</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_3d/Processo_02.webp" alt="Wireframe do modelo 3D no Blender" />
          <span class="case-img-pair__caption" data-en="step 02 · 3D wireframe · Blender">Passo 02 · Wireframe 3D</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="The process started with the <strong>Customic line suppliers</strong>. With the real dimensions in hand — TPU thickness, exact edge radius, and the position of the camera, side and button cutouts — every millimeter of the model was built to faithfully match the physical product. Without that precision, the renders would lose credibility.">
        O processo começou pelos <strong>fornecedores da linha Customic</strong>. Com as dimensões reais em mãos — espessura do TPU, raio exato das bordas, posição dos recortes de câmera, lateral e botões — cada milímetro do modelo foi construído para corresponder fielmente ao produto físico. Sem essa precisão, os renders perderiam credibilidade.
      </p>
      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="The texturing simulated the TPU's matte finish with a procedural roughness map combined with a high-resolution baked normal map, reproducing the material's subtle grain. For the product renders, each scene was set up with <strong>ambient HDRI lighting</strong> and area lights to enhance the controlled reflections.">
        A texturização simulou o acabamento fosco do TPU com um mapa de roughness procedural combinado a um normal map baked de alta resolução, reproduzindo o granulado sutil do material. Para os renders de produto, cada cena foi configurada com <strong>HDRI de iluminação ambiente</strong> e luzes de área para realçar os reflexos controlados.
      </p>
      <p class="case-narrative" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="1" data-en="With the models ready, the next step was the <strong>Animation Triad</strong>: three Instagram reels with a connected visual identity. The challenge was creating transitions and a color palette that tied the three videos together without making them repetitive — each with its own personality, clearly part of the same set.">
        Com os modelos prontos, a etapa seguinte foi a <strong>Tríade de Animações</strong>: três reels para o Instagram com identidade visual conectada. O desafio foi criar transições e paleta de cores que unissem os três vídeos sem torná-los repetitivos — cada um com personalidade própria, claramente parte de um mesmo conjunto.
      </p>

      <div class="case-code" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="2" role="region" aria-label="Pipeline 3D: do fornecedor ao Instagram" data-en="&lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;// 3D Mobifans — pipeline: supplier → model → render → Instagram&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;MODELING&lt;/span&gt;
  Software       &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;Blender 4.x&lt;/span&gt;
  Reference      &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;real measurements&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;provided by the manufacturer&lt;/span&gt;
  Polygons       &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;~12,000 tris&lt;/span&gt;   &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;optimized for render and web&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;MATERIALS&lt;/span&gt;
  Base Color     &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;2K PNG&lt;/span&gt;          &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;printed customization&lt;/span&gt;
  Roughness      &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;1K procedural&lt;/span&gt;  &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;matte TPU finish&lt;/span&gt;
  Normal Map     &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;baked 2K&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;material grain&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;RENDER&lt;/span&gt;
  Engine         &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;Cycles X&lt;/span&gt;
  Samples        &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;512&lt;/span&gt;            &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;maximum quality&lt;/span&gt;
  Lighting       &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;HDRI + area&lt;/span&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;highlights TPU reflections&lt;/span&gt;

&lt;span class=&quot;tok-keyword&quot;&gt;ANIMATION&lt;/span&gt;
  FPS            &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;30 fps&lt;/span&gt;
  Reel length    &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;15–30s&lt;/span&gt;         &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;optimized for Instagram&lt;/span&gt;
  Triad          &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;3 × 20s&lt;/span&gt;        &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;connected visual series&lt;/span&gt;
  Export         &lt;span class=&quot;tok-string&quot;&gt;MP4 · 1080×1920&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;tok-comment&quot;&gt;9:16 vertical reel&lt;/span&gt;"><span class="tok-comment">// 3D Mobifans — pipeline: fornecedor → modelo → render → Instagram</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">MODELAGEM</span>
  Software       <span class="tok-string">Blender 4.x</span>
  Referência     <span class="tok-string">medidas reais</span>  <span class="tok-comment">fornecidas pelo fabricante</span>
  Polígonos      <span class="tok-string">~12.000 tris</span>   <span class="tok-comment">otimizado para render e web</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">MATERIAIS</span>
  Base Color     <span class="tok-string">2K PNG</span>          <span class="tok-comment">personalização impressa</span>
  Roughness      <span class="tok-string">1K procedural</span>  <span class="tok-comment">acabamento TPU fosco</span>
  Normal Map     <span class="tok-string">baked 2K</span>        <span class="tok-comment">granulado do material</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">RENDER</span>
  Engine         <span class="tok-string">Cycles X</span>
  Samples        <span class="tok-string">512</span>            <span class="tok-comment">qualidade máxima</span>
  Iluminação     <span class="tok-string">HDRI + área</span>    <span class="tok-comment">destaque nos reflexos TPU</span>

<span class="tok-keyword">ANIMAÇÃO</span>
  FPS            <span class="tok-string">30 fps</span>
  Duração reels  <span class="tok-string">15–30s</span>         <span class="tok-comment">otimizado para Instagram</span>
  Tríade         <span class="tok-string">3 × 20s</span>        <span class="tok-comment">série visual conectada</span>
  Exportação     <span class="tok-string">MP4 · 1080×1920</span> <span class="tok-comment">9:16 vertical reel</span></div>

      <div class="case-img-pair" data-reveal>
        <div class="case-img-pair__item">
          <img class="case-img-pair__img" src="/projetos/mobi_3d/Processo_03.webp" alt="Imagens de Ecommerce" />
